    col
      h2 Logo
      text These assets are provided for use in situations like articles and video tutorials. Please do not use the logo in any way that could be confusing for customers or imply any affiliation with Pico CSS.
      text Do not modify the logo and make sure it has enough spacing.
      row
        col
          link /build/_assets/pico-logo-light-OKNA7EES.svg /build/_assets/pico-logo-light-OKNA7EES.svg
