            button PNG primary
      h2 Icon#
      text If the situation prevents otherwise, the icon mark may be used instead of the full logo.
      row
        col
          link /build/_assets/pico-mark-light-E4V54OAB.svg /build/_assets/pico-mark-light-E4V54OAB.svg
