            button PNG primary
      h2 Name#
      text When referring to Pico CSS, the correct brand name is “Pico CSS”. You can also use “Pico” or “Pico ✨” if you prefer.
      text The CSS stylesheet can be referred as “pico.css”. However, please avoid using “PicoCss”, “PicoCSS”, “Pico.css”, or “pico”.
      h2 Usage agreement#
      text Pico CSS brand name and logo are protected under intellectual property law.
      text You can use the Pico CSS name as part of the name of your open-source and non-commercial project, such as “Pico-React”, but using the name in commercial projects without permission is not allowed.
      text You cannot use the Pico CSS logo for open or closed source projects, but you’re welcome to use it in articles or documentation as long as proper credit is given.
      text The use of the Pico CSS brand name and logo on merchandise, such as t-shirts or stickers, requires explicit written consent.
